]]\n* 1 can (4 ounces)  [[Cookbook:Mushroom|mushrooms]]\n* 1 can (15 ounces) sweet [[Cookbook:Pea|peas]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] cooked brown [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n* [[Cookbook:Cooking Spray|cooking spray]]\n* ½ cup slivered [[Cookbook:Almond|almonds]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to [[Cookbook:Oven_temperatures|350°F]].\n# Combine cheese, mushrooms, peas, and rice in large bowl.\n# Coat 1½ [[Cookbook:Quart|quart]] [[Cookbook:Pots and Pans|baking pan]] with cooking spray.\n# Move mixed ingredients to baking dish.\n# Cover and [[Cookbook:Baking|bake]] for 20 to 25 minutes.\n# Sprinkle almonds on top\n# Bake 5 minutes more.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n* Instant brown rice will work fine.\n* Mushroom \"stems and pieces\" are okay.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes]]\n[[Category:United States recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for casserole]]\n[[Category:Recipes using almond]]\n[[Category:Recipes using processed cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mushroom]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peas]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown rice]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Side dish recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cooking spray]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Brown Rice Casserole","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"8 ounces cubed processed cheese","sourceText":"8 ounces cubed processed cheese","amountText":"8 ounces cubed processed cheese","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 can (4 ounces)  mushrooms","sourceText":"1 can (4 ounces)  mushrooms","amountText":"1 can (4 ounces)  mushrooms","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 can (15 ounces) sweet peas","sourceText":"1 can (15 ounces) sweet peas","amountText":"1 can (15 ounces) sweet peas","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"3 cups cooked br